1
00:01:15,359 --> 00:01:16,200
What?

2
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,000
You're gonna marry

3
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:18,599
him?

4
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:19,959
Keep your voice down.

5
00:01:19,959 --> 00:01:22,239
Do you want everyone to know we lost the goods?

6
00:01:23,159 --> 00:01:24,879
But you can't marry him!

7
00:01:25,719 --> 00:01:26,519
Yeah, My Lady.

8
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:28,560
We can just take the loss.

9
00:01:30,599 --> 00:01:31,319
I thought about it.

10
00:01:31,319 --> 00:01:32,879
It's just a formality.

11
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:35,000
The important thing is not to tarnish the agency's reputation.

12
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:37,359
You go to the courier station first.

13
00:01:37,359 --> 00:01:38,879
I'll meet you when I get out.

14
00:01:39,439 --> 00:01:41,519
Boss, don't fall into his trap.

15
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:43,239
In case he is so hungry that

16
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,680
he forces you to...

17
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,519
He?

18
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:47,400
I can beat two of them with one punch.

19
00:01:47,599 --> 00:01:48,319
Right.

20
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:49,760
We should be worried about the boss.

21
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:51,079
Forcing...

22
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:54,040
Boss,

23
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:56,239
I have a bold idea.

24
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,200
Do you want to hear it?

25
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,040
No.

26
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,840
Then I'll say it.

27
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,120
You're recruiting a son-in-law anyway.

28
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:01,560
Why don't you...

29
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:03,200
I'm recruiting a son-in-law,

30
00:02:03,319 --> 00:02:04,239
not snatching a bride.

31
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,519
If you keep talking nonsense,

32
00:02:05,519 --> 00:02:06,519
I'll ask my brother to make a cover

33
00:02:06,519 --> 00:02:07,799
to seal your mouth.

34
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,800
Stick to the plan.

35
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,680
My dear.

36
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,159
Come on,

37
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:12,879
let's have a drink together.

38
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:15,199
Congratulations to Lord Cheng and Madam Cheng.

39
00:04:15,199 --> 00:04:16,920
Congratulations.

40
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:29,399
Our Cheng family has been generals for generations,

41
00:04:30,319 --> 00:04:33,399
but now it seems to have ended with you.

42
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,040
Ah.

43
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,639
Here we go again.

44
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:39,040
A man should start a career after getting married.

45
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,879
If you had been learning martial arts,

46
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:45,319
I could have helped you a lot.

47
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,800
Don't look at me now.

48
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,439
I used to have

49
00:04:49,439 --> 00:04:50,879
tens of thousands of soldiers

50
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:52,319
charging across the battlefield.

51
00:04:53,879 --> 00:04:57,160
But now I'm stuck in this place,

52
00:04:57,759 --> 00:04:59,959
and I can't even control my own son.

53
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:02,639
Ah...

54
00:05:27,639 --> 00:05:28,439
Dad,

55
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,360
I'm already married.

56
00:05:31,439 --> 00:05:32,439
As you wish.

57
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,759
What else do you want?

58
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:39,160
I don't want to argue with you on this day.

59
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:46,000
It's best for father and son to be kind to each other.

60
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:50,120
Come on, I'll toast to you.

61
00:05:54,439 --> 00:05:55,240
This brat.

62
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,680
What's he up to?

63
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,519
He's very abnormal today.

64
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,399
My wife.

65
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,839
My dear wife.

66
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:22,680
Sorry to keep you waiting.

67
00:06:24,319 --> 00:06:25,879
My wife.

68
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:27,079
I'll teach you a lesson.

69
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:46,839
It's good to be young,

70
00:06:46,839 --> 00:06:48,160
and have a good waist.

71
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,600
What are you talking about?

72
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:56,360
Ouch.

73
00:06:57,439 --> 00:06:58,680
Oh, my wife,

74
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,639
are you okay?

75
00:06:59,959 --> 00:07:00,959
Tell me,

76
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,800
what do you want to do?

77
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:05,120
Oh, Chief Su,

78
00:07:05,279 --> 00:07:06,560
With your martial arts skills,

79
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,879
what can I do to you?

80
00:07:11,399 --> 00:07:13,560
If I weren't so gentle,

81
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:16,480
you would've been killed by my fists.

82
00:07:26,959 --> 00:07:28,199
Come on, my wife.

83
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:29,000
Get up.

84
00:07:29,839 --> 00:07:30,920
Come on, my wife.

85
00:07:33,959 --> 00:07:34,759
Ah.

86
00:07:35,319 --> 00:07:36,120
My wife,

87
00:07:36,959 --> 00:07:38,639
you've had a long day.

88
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:40,120
It's getting late.

89
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,759
We should get some rest.

90
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,240
Let's go.

91
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,439
You're actually enjoying this?

92
00:07:47,439 --> 00:07:48,319
You're not any better.

93
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,920
Alright,

94
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,800
they're already gone.

95
00:07:56,319 --> 00:07:57,360
You've had a long day.

96
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:59,560
Get some rest.

97
00:08:01,759 --> 00:08:02,560
Sorry about that.

98
00:08:02,839 --> 00:08:04,879
I lost control of my strength.

99
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,279
It's fine, I'm used to it.

100
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:11,439
Can you give me the escort completion certificate now?

101
00:08:13,519 --> 00:08:14,319
Ouch.

102
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:17,240
It still hurts a bit.

103
00:08:17,439 --> 00:08:19,680
Do you think my arm is broken?

104
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,879
Stop acting.

105
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,240
My mission is completed.

106
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,079
Can I go now?

107
00:08:25,079 --> 00:08:26,480
It's getting late.

108
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:28,480
It's really not safe for you to walk alone at night.

109
00:08:28,959 --> 00:08:29,759
How about this?

110
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:33,240
I'll send you away after you serve tea to my parents tomorrow.

111
00:08:33,279 --> 00:08:34,799
Don't push your luck.

112
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:37,919
I only agreed to the wedding ceremony.

113
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:40,080
The tea ceremony is another matter.

114
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:42,000
You have to go all out

115
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,679
to make it look real.

116
00:08:43,759 --> 00:08:45,639
So many people saw me get married.

117
00:08:45,639 --> 00:08:47,480
If the bride is missing the next day,

118
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,840
who do you think my family will blame?

119
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,919
You set me up on purpose, didn't you?

120
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:54,759
Stop.

121
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,799
Let me be honest with you.

122
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,360
I got married

123
00:09:01,759 --> 00:09:03,440
just to leave Ning'an

124
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,759
and go to Yunjing.

125
00:09:05,559 --> 00:09:07,879
As long as you help me finish this play today,

126
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,679
and take me away from here tomorrow,

127
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:13,000
I swear I'll never bother you again.

128
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:15,240
Besides, my parents don't know you.

129
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:17,039
They won't see you again.

130
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:20,039
How dare you treat

131
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,960
marriage as a joke?

132
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:27,080
It's all thanks to you

133
00:09:27,559 --> 00:09:29,559
for posting a notice in Yunjing,

134
00:09:29,559 --> 00:09:30,679
which reminded me.

135
00:09:30,879 --> 00:09:31,879
You too.

136
00:09:43,639 --> 00:09:44,279
Father,

137
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:47,279
how's the Nebula Assembly prep going?

138
00:09:47,799 --> 00:09:49,039
I personally screened

139
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,720
every participant.

140
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,559
The Yun State has enjoyed peace for years.

141
00:09:58,080 --> 00:10:00,600
If your business had a backing,

142
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,080
from the official

143
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,159
to the public,

144
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:05,559
Do you know what that means?

145
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:08,600
It means endless wealth.

146
00:10:08,879 --> 00:10:11,759
So the winner of the Nebula Assembly

147
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:14,960
must be someone you can control.

148
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:15,879
Father, rest assured.

149
00:10:16,159 --> 00:10:17,799
I will make sure everything is in order.

150
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:18,679
Good.

151
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,440
Go.

152
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:21,279
Yes.

153
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:31,519
Ah.

154
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:34,480
Miss Yan is indeed a fraud.

155
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:37,840
Hmph, I think you two are a good match.

156
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:38,879
A liar

157
00:10:38,879 --> 00:10:40,679
and a fool.

158
00:10:42,919 --> 00:10:44,000
Wait.

159
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:48,639
Tell me why you set me up.

160
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:51,519
Please be gentle, Chief Su.

161
00:10:51,559 --> 00:10:53,279
I can't beat you.

162
00:10:53,679 --> 00:10:55,000
Besides, think about it.

163
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:57,759
It's not your name on the marriage certificate.

164
00:10:57,759 --> 00:10:59,000
How could I have lied to you?

165
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:05,919
Why did Meng Feifei write your name

166
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,120
on the marriage contract?

167
00:11:07,919 --> 00:11:09,320
How can there be two groups

168
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,080
of people intercepting the escort?

169
00:11:11,799 --> 00:11:13,960
How can you be so smart and be fooled by Miss Yan?

170
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:14,720
Wait.

171
00:11:16,519 --> 00:11:19,720
Meng Feifei said I was your destiny.

172
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,600
Yes.

173
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:26,240
Meng Feifei is really something.

174
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,600
You haven't answered my question.

175
00:11:34,519 --> 00:11:35,879
I'm in a hurry to get married

176
00:11:35,879 --> 00:11:37,879
because I'm going to Nebula Assembly tomorrow.

177
00:11:37,879 --> 00:11:39,120
If I don't have a wife,

178
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,360
I can't leave Ning'an.

179
00:11:40,519 --> 00:11:41,919
I've only met Meng Feifei once.

180
00:11:41,919 --> 00:11:42,440
She's too expensive.

181
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,279
So I didn't hire her.

182
00:11:43,279 --> 00:11:45,120
And I met Miss Yan at the Matchmaker Pavilion.

183
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,360
She wants money, and I need her help.

184
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,519
Miss Su, I know you're a good person.

185
00:11:47,519 --> 00:11:48,320
If you help me,

186
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,399
I'll owe you a favor from now on.

187
00:11:49,399 --> 00:11:50,240
As long as I can afford to help,

188
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,039
I will definitely

189
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,480
do my best.

190
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:56,759
Well, you speak too fast.

191
00:11:56,759 --> 00:11:57,879
I didn't hear it clearly.

192
00:11:57,879 --> 00:11:59,600
In short,

193
00:11:59,679 --> 00:12:01,480
please help me this time.

194
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:02,840
I...

195
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:03,279
Thank you.

196
00:12:03,279 --> 00:12:04,159
You need to offer tea tomorrow morning.

197
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:04,960
Go to bed early.

198
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,120
You're not covering yourself.

199
00:12:32,879 --> 00:12:34,159
Now that one more thing

200
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:36,159
has been taken care of,

201
00:12:36,399 --> 00:12:38,639
why do you still look so worried?

202
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:41,799
I thought he was acting strange last night.

203
00:12:42,159 --> 00:12:44,559
This marriage is so weird.

204
00:12:45,159 --> 00:12:46,840
Don't worry about it.

205
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:49,279
Let the new daughter-in-law deal with him.

206
00:12:49,679 --> 00:12:51,440
You two are always arguing.

207
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,960
New daughter-in-law?

208
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:55,720
I don't think she's sensible.

209
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:57,360
It's late,

210
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,639
and she hasn't served tea yet.

211
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:01,120
Don't worry.

212
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:03,080
I'll ask Yicheng

213
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,120
to check on her.

214
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:04,799
No need.

215
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:06,279
I'll go myself.

216
00:13:26,799 --> 00:13:28,720
You are a girl.

217
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,679
How can you not even wear a hairpin?

218
00:13:31,279 --> 00:13:32,320
Didn't your mother teach you?

219
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,000
I...

220
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:37,720
My mom...

221
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,000
Well,

222
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,080
as an escort,

223
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:41,000
you don't care about these details.

224
00:13:41,279 --> 00:13:42,440
You don't need these.

225
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:45,320
But it's okay. I'll help you.

226
00:13:48,399 --> 00:13:50,240
You can just let me take you away.

227
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:52,600
Why do you insist on serving tea?

228
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,679
I want to make my parents happy.

229
00:13:58,399 --> 00:13:59,720
You're a good son.

230
00:13:59,879 --> 00:14:00,919
If so,

231
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:02,960
why do you always look indifferent?

232
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,320
Do I?

233
00:14:09,679 --> 00:14:10,480
Come on.

234
00:14:10,879 --> 00:14:12,279
Just sip this.

235
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:20,279
Hmm.

236
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,200
That's enough.

237
00:14:22,639 --> 00:14:24,240
You can tell my parents

238
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,159
that you want to go home.

239
00:14:25,679 --> 00:14:27,639
And you have to take me with you

240
00:14:27,639 --> 00:14:28,799
to Yunjing.

241
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:30,440
After arriving in Yunjing City,

242
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,639
we'll go our separate ways.

243
00:14:32,679 --> 00:14:33,440
I...

244
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:33,799
Ah.

245
00:14:34,519 --> 00:14:36,039
Everyone knows that

246
00:14:36,039 --> 00:14:38,440
I'm marrying Miss Yan.

247
00:14:39,159 --> 00:14:41,440
We are not husband and wife in name,

248
00:14:41,519 --> 00:14:42,799
nor in reality.

249
00:14:42,919 --> 00:14:45,759
The certificate proves you completed the escort.

250
00:14:45,759 --> 00:14:47,519
and you have nothing to do with this.

251
00:14:47,679 --> 00:14:48,639
It will protect your reputation.

252
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:52,799
It's very considerate of you.

253
00:14:53,159 --> 00:14:54,639
But how will you explain it

254
00:14:54,639 --> 00:14:55,919
to your parents?

255
00:14:55,919 --> 00:14:56,759
Hehe.

256
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:57,919
Don't worry.

257
00:14:58,039 --> 00:15:00,240
I'll make up an excuse.

258
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:01,039
Let's go.

259
00:15:02,879 --> 00:15:03,679
Go.

260
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:05,519
Go.

261
00:15:11,399 --> 00:15:13,919
Why do you escort in such a windy day?

262
00:15:17,399 --> 00:15:18,200
Ah.

263
00:15:20,039 --> 00:15:22,240
This young master wants to hire an escort.

264
00:15:22,279 --> 00:15:23,759
I'm looking for a female escort.

265
00:15:25,919 --> 00:15:26,759
Why?

266
00:15:27,559 --> 00:15:28,639
You have a grudge against her?

267
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:30,120
Are you here to seek revenge?

268
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,639
I want to be an escort.

269
00:15:33,759 --> 00:15:36,159
To be an escort for a woman?

270
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,240
You have no ambition.

271
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,639
Hey, hey.

272
00:15:39,639 --> 00:15:41,440
Bro, let's talk this out.

273
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,360
Say it again.

274
00:15:44,159 --> 00:15:45,279
She's out on a mission

275
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,519
and hasn't returned yet.

276
00:15:49,039 --> 00:15:49,960
You want to be an escort?

277
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:51,480
I can hire you?

278
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:53,960
Haven't returned yet?

279
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:55,919
Could she have been hurt by those men in black?

280
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:56,759
Oh, no.

281
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:58,519
Hey.

282
00:16:00,759 --> 00:16:02,120
Try running slower.

283
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:04,879
What were you doing just now?

284
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:07,200
And you, what were you doing?

285
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:10,399
Let's go.

286
00:16:19,759 --> 00:16:21,200
Dressing like this again.

287
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,480
So uncomfortable.

288
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:29,960
Ah, ah.

289
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:37,360
Good moves.

290
00:16:37,559 --> 00:16:38,120
Good strength.

291
00:16:45,879 --> 00:16:46,679
Ouch.

292
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,519
Ouch.

293
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:57,960
Father, stop just panting.

294
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,639
Please enjoy the tea.

295
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:04,559
The tea served by my daughter-in-law must be good.

296
00:17:04,640 --> 00:17:06,680
I just blow it a bit.

297
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:08,119
You, you kid.

298
00:17:10,759 --> 00:17:11,559
Daughter-in-law,

299
00:17:12,279 --> 00:17:15,839
you need to pay more attention to his studies in the future.

300
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,000
Yes.

301
00:17:18,799 --> 00:17:20,240
I will take care of myself.

302
00:17:20,519 --> 00:17:22,480
I won't let you worry.

303
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,960
How come this guy is like a different person?

304
00:17:26,119 --> 00:17:27,519
He can say such things.

305
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:30,519
Good, as long as you two are in harmony.

306
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:33,960
Remember what I said.

307
00:17:35,279 --> 00:17:37,160
And, my daughter-in-law,

308
00:17:37,759 --> 00:17:40,319
if he does anything outrageous again,

309
00:17:40,599 --> 00:17:42,200
just come to us.

310
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:45,359
We'll stand up for you.

311
00:17:48,440 --> 00:17:49,680
Got it.

312
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:51,079
Dad, mom.

313
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,480
You're so quick to call us that.

314
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:58,000
Come on, get up.

315
00:18:02,839 --> 00:18:03,880
You're such a good boy.

316
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:04,880
Now that you're here,

317
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:06,640
Master will be relieved.

318
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:07,759
Haha.

319
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:09,599
Our Cheng family

320
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:11,559
is a military aristocratic family,

321
00:18:12,279 --> 00:18:13,519
guarding our home and country,

322
00:18:13,799 --> 00:18:14,960
and defending a region.

323
00:18:17,119 --> 00:18:18,519
But my son

324
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:20,799
has no martial arts skills.

325
00:18:21,720 --> 00:18:24,960
He's a disgrace to our family.

326
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:27,599
You don't like writing,

327
00:18:27,599 --> 00:18:29,519
and I don't like martial arts.

328
00:18:29,599 --> 00:18:30,839
Why do you say that?

329
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:33,920
Good, you can talk back.

330
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:35,279
You're not that stupid.

331
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:37,119
I was just about to praise you,

332
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:39,039
but you're being stubborn again.

333
00:18:39,759 --> 00:18:40,839
Enough.

334
00:18:40,839 --> 00:18:42,200
It's a big day.

335
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:43,519
Why are you saying this?

336
00:18:46,279 --> 00:18:47,680
He's married.

337
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:49,039
and has a wife to take care of him,

338
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:50,880
he'll be responsible.

339
00:18:51,599 --> 00:18:53,160
That's for the future.

340
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:55,319
But for now, it's just between me and my wife.

341
00:18:58,559 --> 00:18:59,400
Fortunately,

342
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:03,039
we have a capable daughter-in-law.

343
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:04,799
With you taking care of him,

344
00:19:04,799 --> 00:19:06,279
I can rest easy.

345
00:19:06,599 --> 00:19:07,839
That's the best.

346
00:19:08,279 --> 00:19:10,559
Just have another

347
00:19:12,079 --> 00:19:13,039
grandson who can fight.

348
00:19:15,839 --> 00:19:17,480
I'll protect you.

349
00:19:17,839 --> 00:19:20,720
You can focus on your studies.

350
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:21,599
Right?

351
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,839
Shouldn't we leave now?

352
00:19:25,839 --> 00:19:26,720
Get to the point.

353
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:27,440
I know.

354
00:19:29,279 --> 00:19:30,559
She's right.

355
00:19:30,759 --> 00:19:34,160
I'm heading to Qiyong Academy in Yunjing City.

356
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:37,640
She mentioned homesickness last night,

357
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:40,839
so we'll leave soon.

358
00:19:40,839 --> 00:19:41,680
Yes.

359
00:19:43,079 --> 00:19:44,359
Well,

360
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:46,200
it's okay.

361
00:19:46,759 --> 00:19:48,200
As long as you take care of him,

362
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:49,279
I'll feel relieved.

363
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:51,200
Remember, discipline him when necessary.

364
00:19:51,799 --> 00:19:52,720
I won't feel sorry.

365
00:19:53,440 --> 00:19:54,440
I know, Dad.

366
00:19:54,559 --> 00:19:56,880
I'll teach him well.

367
00:19:57,839 --> 00:19:59,799
We'll pack our luggage now.

368
00:19:59,799 --> 00:20:00,519
Wait.

369
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:07,400
I disagree.

370
00:20:09,839 --> 00:20:11,400
Mom, come on.

371
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:12,160
Last night,

372
00:20:12,160 --> 00:20:14,240
she cried all night because she missed home.

373
00:20:14,759 --> 00:20:16,480
I really feel sorry for her.

374
00:20:16,759 --> 00:20:18,319
Please let me take her back.

375
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:25,079
Yes.

376
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:29,440
She just got here yesterday.

377
00:20:29,759 --> 00:20:31,640
If you take her back today,

378
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,799
people will think we're rude.

379
00:20:34,319 --> 00:20:35,759
This is not...

380
00:20:45,519 --> 00:20:47,680
Betrothal gifts and wedding banquet.

381
00:20:48,119 --> 00:20:50,240
We've spent almost all the money.

382
00:20:50,519 --> 00:20:52,359
We haven't prepared the return visit gift yet.

383
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:54,799
Ah, mom, she is sensible.

384
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:56,720
She has prepared all these things.

385
00:20:57,119 --> 00:20:59,279
So I feel more and more sorry for her.

386
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:13,559
My lord, since the child is willing to

387
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:15,640
do something decent,

388
00:21:15,680 --> 00:21:18,240
how about letting them go back first?

389
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:19,119
Yeah.

390
00:21:22,799 --> 00:21:23,759
My daughter-in-law,

391
00:21:23,759 --> 00:21:25,519
when you arrive in Yunjing City,

392
00:21:25,799 --> 00:21:28,079
if he gets into any trouble,

393
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:30,839
it's your business.

394
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:35,359
You can tie him up if necessary.

395
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:38,319
Dad, mom, don't worry.

396
00:21:38,400 --> 00:21:39,200
He dares not.

397
00:21:39,200 --> 00:21:39,799
Right?

398
00:21:40,119 --> 00:21:40,880
My dear.

399
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:41,519
Yes.

400
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:43,759
Of course.

401
00:21:44,519 --> 00:21:45,319
Humph.

402
00:21:50,599 --> 00:21:51,640
Put them there.

403
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:52,200
Yes.

404
00:21:54,279 --> 00:21:55,680
Grandpa,

405
00:21:55,839 --> 00:21:57,240
why are you sitting in the draft?

406
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:58,519
You might catch a cold.

407
00:21:58,599 --> 00:21:59,519
Let me take you back to the room.

408
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:02,920
Jiaojiao hasn't come back from Ning'an yet.

409
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:04,160
I'll wait for her.

410
00:22:04,160 --> 00:22:05,839
Don't worry, it's a long way to Ning'an.

411
00:22:05,880 --> 00:22:07,000
It's normal to be delayed.

412
00:22:07,119 --> 00:22:08,279
Go back and have some tea.

413
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:10,960
Come on, lift it up.

414
00:22:10,960 --> 00:22:11,880
Are you eating?

415
00:22:12,640 --> 00:22:13,440
Hurry up.

416
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:22,039
Do you need escorts?

417
00:22:27,119 --> 00:22:28,319
Master Su.

418
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:31,559
I'm Zhen Sanliang from the east of the city.

419
00:22:31,759 --> 00:22:33,480
This is my son, Zhen Dabao.

420
00:22:33,839 --> 00:22:36,119
I heard that Miss Su is graceful and beautiful.

421
00:22:36,519 --> 00:22:39,039
So I brought my son to propose

422
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:40,400
to show my sincerity.

423
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,039
Oh.

424
00:22:45,519 --> 00:22:48,960
I know the Second-in-Command.

425
00:22:50,319 --> 00:22:54,160
You are the newly moved Bailiff Zhen

426
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:56,680
in the east of the city.

427
00:22:56,680 --> 00:22:58,079
Yes, that's right.

428
00:23:00,079 --> 00:23:02,720
My sister may not be as virtuous as you said.

429
00:23:02,799 --> 00:23:05,640
You may have come in vain.

430
00:23:05,799 --> 00:23:06,480
It doesn't matter.

431
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:08,640
The Second-in-Command has already told me

432
00:23:08,680 --> 00:23:11,640
that we're here to arrange the marriage.

433
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:14,240
In that case,

434
00:23:14,559 --> 00:23:15,319
Da Qi,

435
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:17,480
take them to the guest room.

436
00:23:17,519 --> 00:23:19,680
Let's discuss it when Li Shi and Jiaojiao return.

437
00:23:24,359 --> 00:23:26,839
Come, carry the luggage inside.

438
00:23:26,839 --> 00:23:28,039
Dabao, let's go.

439
00:23:38,519 --> 00:23:40,000
Your son

440
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:44,119
is quite adorable.

441
00:23:45,680 --> 00:23:49,200
What does he do for a living?

442
00:23:49,400 --> 00:23:50,200
Oh,

443
00:23:50,640 --> 00:23:51,720
Dabao is two years older

444
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:54,200
than Miss Su.

445
00:23:58,519 --> 00:23:59,880
His mother spoiled him.

446
00:24:00,319 --> 00:24:01,079
He looks younger.

447
00:24:01,759 --> 00:24:03,599
Our Zhen family

448
00:24:03,599 --> 00:24:04,680
has farmland.

449
00:24:05,039 --> 00:24:06,640
If Miss Su marries into our family,

450
00:24:06,640 --> 00:24:08,160
she'll live a comfortable life.

451
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:10,559
Haha.

452
00:24:10,599 --> 00:24:14,319
Dabao, perform a show for your brother-in-law and grandfather.

453
00:24:19,960 --> 00:24:22,839
Let's go home. I miss mom.

454
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:27,680
Look at him. He's so homesick.

455
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:29,079
He will definitely

456
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:30,480
love his wife.

457
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:34,119
You're right.

458
00:24:34,839 --> 00:24:36,000
So unique.

459
00:24:36,039 --> 00:24:38,880
Hahaha.

460
00:24:39,839 --> 00:24:41,039
My sister is hot-tempered

461
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:42,200
and plain-looking.

462
00:24:42,599 --> 00:24:43,839
I'm afraid she's not good enough

463
00:24:43,920 --> 00:24:44,880
for you.

464
00:24:44,880 --> 00:24:47,240
Oh, don't worry.

465
00:24:47,440 --> 00:24:49,799
I believe Miss Su

466
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:51,960
can take good care of my son.

467
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:55,759
It's not appropriate at home.

468
00:25:01,279 --> 00:25:02,720
Yicheng, go!

469
00:25:02,720 --> 00:25:04,920
Dig out all the money I hid.

470
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:05,640
All of it?

471
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:06,200
Yes.

472
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:06,720
Go now!

473
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:07,720
Okay, okay.

474
00:25:14,599 --> 00:25:16,359
Why was your dad so ruthless?

475
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:18,160
He beat me without saying a word.

476
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:19,519
You're used to it.

477
00:25:20,359 --> 00:25:22,039
That's my daily routine since childhood.

478
00:25:22,039 --> 00:25:23,519
My father didn't expect that

479
00:25:23,519 --> 00:25:25,240
although I can't learn martial arts,

480
00:25:25,240 --> 00:25:27,400
I can dodge.

481
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:28,599
He can hardly hit me.

482
00:25:29,759 --> 00:25:31,160
What a far-sighted man!

483
00:25:31,200 --> 00:25:32,559
Your father must have seen that

484
00:25:32,559 --> 00:25:33,640
you are a person

485
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:34,519
who deserves a beating.

486
00:25:35,519 --> 00:25:36,720
Boss, who needs a beating?

487
00:25:36,839 --> 00:25:37,759
We're coming.

488
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:45,519
Wow.

489
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:48,000
Boss.

490
00:25:49,839 --> 00:25:50,640
Wow.

491
00:25:51,799 --> 00:25:52,599
Wow.

492
00:25:54,119 --> 00:25:55,240
You two wait a minute.

493
00:25:56,279 --> 00:25:57,680
How did you get in?

494
00:26:02,200 --> 00:26:03,720
Oh, Gong Xi, Fa Cai.

495
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:05,200
I don't have red envelopes.

496
00:26:05,880 --> 00:26:07,480
They have been with me since childhood.

497
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:08,519
since they were little.

498
00:26:10,640 --> 00:26:11,640
I see.

499
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:14,400
Let's talk about it on the way.

500
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:15,400
When Yicheng comes back,

501
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:16,960
we'll set off for Yunjing City.

502
00:26:16,960 --> 00:26:17,440
Okay.

503
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:18,319
Pack up.

504
00:26:18,319 --> 00:26:18,759
Okay.

505
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:22,440
Boss, she

506
00:26:23,200 --> 00:26:24,160
is not right.

507
00:26:24,480 --> 00:26:25,880
She found herself a

508
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:27,920
live-in son-in-law.

509
00:26:29,799 --> 00:26:30,839
Live-in son-in-law?

510
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:38,039
Butler,

511
00:26:38,799 --> 00:26:39,480
here's the thing.

512
00:26:41,400 --> 00:26:42,440
They asked me

513
00:26:42,440 --> 00:26:43,599
if I have any sisters

514
00:26:43,599 --> 00:26:45,559
who want to be their live-in son-in-law.

515
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:46,480
Ah?

516
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:52,400
They escorted me here for the wedding.

517
00:26:53,880 --> 00:26:54,680
From Yunjing City?

518
00:26:55,680 --> 00:26:57,039
Yes.

519
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:58,119
We are escorts.

520
00:26:58,119 --> 00:26:58,960
We're here to check

521
00:26:59,119 --> 00:27:00,880
if the escorted person is safe.

522
00:27:01,960 --> 00:27:03,440
There are such rules?

523
00:27:03,480 --> 00:27:05,079
Which agency?

524
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:07,599
I'll hire them next time.

525
00:27:08,039 --> 00:27:09,480
Su's Escort Agency in Yunjing.

526
00:27:09,759 --> 00:27:10,359
Escort?

527
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:15,799
What did you bring, butler?

528
00:27:16,759 --> 00:27:18,240
My lady asked me to send some food

529
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:19,599
for you to eat on the road.

530
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:21,000
Young Master,

531
00:27:21,000 --> 00:27:22,519
the guards have prepared the carriage.

532
00:27:22,519 --> 00:27:24,160
You can set off at any time.

533
00:27:24,319 --> 00:27:26,480
No need, these two escorts

534
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:28,039
happen to be going back to Yunjing City.

535
00:27:28,039 --> 00:27:29,119
Let them take us.

536
00:27:29,119 --> 00:27:29,839
It's cheaper.

537
00:27:32,960 --> 00:27:34,200
Tell my father,

538
00:27:34,200 --> 00:27:34,920
these

539
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:36,799
were arranged by the Young Madam.

540
00:27:38,599 --> 00:27:39,640
Yes,

541
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:42,440
Young Madam.

542
00:27:45,160 --> 00:27:45,960
Hehe.

543
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:51,200
Bailiff Zhen is right.

544
00:27:51,599 --> 00:27:52,759
Jiaojiao

545
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:53,920
and Dabao

546
00:28:01,920 --> 00:28:03,559
are a good match.

547
00:28:04,480 --> 00:28:05,599
She'll be lucky for her.

548
00:28:07,319 --> 00:28:08,119
Humph.

549
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:10,599
You came back just in time.

550
00:28:10,599 --> 00:28:12,960
Zhen Yuanwai is here to propose a marriage.

551
00:28:12,960 --> 00:28:15,119
How can I not be here?

552
00:28:15,319 --> 00:28:16,920
Where's Jiaojiao?

553
00:28:17,319 --> 00:28:18,440
She hasn't come back yet.

554
00:28:19,480 --> 00:28:21,200
Did she go to fight again?

555
00:28:22,519 --> 00:28:23,519
Li Shi,

556
00:28:23,880 --> 00:28:25,279
you're back just in time.

557
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:27,240
You can talk more.

558
00:28:27,240 --> 00:28:28,400
Da Qi,

559
00:28:28,960 --> 00:28:30,079
help me back.

560
00:28:30,079 --> 00:28:31,640
I'm not feeling well.

561
00:28:32,359 --> 00:28:33,599
Dad.

562
00:28:34,039 --> 00:28:34,880
I'll stay with them.

563
00:28:35,039 --> 00:28:36,039
Don't worry.

564
00:28:36,039 --> 00:28:37,799
Have a good rest.

565
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:45,200
What kind of person did you find?

566
00:28:47,200 --> 00:28:48,680
If you have a daughter,

567
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:50,400
would you let her marry this guy?

568
00:28:52,920 --> 00:28:53,880
He's matrilocal,

569
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:54,759
obedient,

570
00:28:54,759 --> 00:28:55,559
and doesn't cause trouble.

571
00:28:55,960 --> 00:28:57,240
How great!

572
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:00,039
The most important thing is that

573
00:29:00,039 --> 00:29:01,160
he knows kong fu,

574
00:29:01,359 --> 00:29:02,640
and he's good at it.

575
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:04,960
Oh.

576
00:29:07,119 --> 00:29:08,599
If that's the case,

577
00:29:09,119 --> 00:29:10,720
then it's not a big problem.

578
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:17,720
My Lord,

579
00:29:17,720 --> 00:29:19,480
is he really not your son-in-law?

580
00:29:19,799 --> 00:29:22,480
Nothing happened last night.

581
00:29:23,519 --> 00:29:25,200
What do you think could happen?

582
00:29:25,880 --> 00:29:28,039
Then why did you bring them back?

583
00:29:28,400 --> 00:29:29,680
We are escorts.

584
00:29:29,720 --> 00:29:31,160
He paid me, so I escorted him.

585
00:29:31,240 --> 00:29:32,359
Is there any problem?

586
00:29:32,599 --> 00:29:33,240
My lord,

587
00:29:33,240 --> 00:29:34,039
I think

588
00:29:34,039 --> 00:29:36,240
this Young Master Cheng is better than the others.

589
00:29:36,519 --> 00:29:38,160
Why don't we just go with the flow

590
00:29:38,519 --> 00:29:39,640
and take him back to the escort agency?

591
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:42,279
He does look pretty good.

592
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:43,519
Hey,

593
00:29:43,920 --> 00:29:44,559
he's a scholar.

594
00:29:44,559 --> 00:29:46,079
Why should I take him back to the escort agency?

595
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:47,240
To tell me stories?

596
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:51,519
Didn't you listen to him at the Cheng Mansion just now?

597
00:29:51,799 --> 00:29:53,519
That was just an act.

598
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:55,119
Come on, let's go home.

599
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:56,240
Grandpa must be worried.

600
00:30:01,799 --> 00:30:02,680
Actually,

601
00:30:02,680 --> 00:30:04,039
he also pretended to get married.

602
00:30:04,039 --> 00:30:04,759
What?

603
00:30:05,200 --> 00:30:06,960
He just wanted to run away from home.

604
00:30:07,640 --> 00:30:09,200
His father is the County Sheriff of Ning'an,

605
00:30:09,200 --> 00:30:10,079
with excellent martial arts skills.

606
00:30:10,200 --> 00:30:11,880
But he doesn't know any martial arts.

607
00:30:12,160 --> 00:30:14,319
He is beaten by his father every day.

608
00:30:14,319 --> 00:30:15,519
Ah.

609
00:30:23,519 --> 00:30:25,039
Please wait in the carriage for a while.

610
00:30:25,279 --> 00:30:26,079
We'll set off soon.

611
00:30:26,279 --> 00:30:27,559
Chief Escort Su,

612
00:30:27,960 --> 00:30:29,519
I have some urgent matters.

613
00:30:29,519 --> 00:30:31,319
Can we go another day?

614
00:30:31,880 --> 00:30:32,920
Just buying some specialties.

615
00:30:32,920 --> 00:30:33,759
Won't take long.

616
00:30:33,880 --> 00:30:34,680
Specialties?

617
00:30:34,680 --> 00:30:35,240
You should've said so earlier.

618
00:30:35,240 --> 00:30:36,039
I have some.

619
00:30:42,200 --> 00:30:43,240
Ning'an is famous

620
00:30:43,240 --> 00:30:44,480
for its elegance.

621
00:30:44,759 --> 00:30:47,799
This is the most collectible specialty.

622
00:30:48,640 --> 00:30:50,519
Perfect for gifts or personal use.

623
00:30:52,640 --> 00:30:55,119
Are you trying to trick me?

624
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:56,319
How dare I?

625
00:30:56,839 --> 00:30:58,319
I don't think you dare.

626
00:30:59,680 --> 00:31:00,880
That's very thoughtful of you.

627
00:31:03,640 --> 00:31:04,880
Young Master,

628
00:31:05,160 --> 00:31:07,160
if Chief Su finds out it's just your poetry anthology,

629
00:31:07,359 --> 00:31:08,599
will he leave us on the roadside?

630
00:31:08,599 --> 00:31:09,960
What's wrong with my poetry anthology?

631
00:31:10,359 --> 00:31:11,559
It's the only one in Ning'an.

632
00:31:11,559 --> 00:31:12,359
How unique.

633
00:31:13,599 --> 00:31:14,400
Get on the cart.

634
00:31:33,000 --> 00:31:35,039
Are you sure you didn't find any blood?

635
00:31:35,079 --> 00:31:36,480
She's really not injured.

636
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:38,960
Not injured.

637
00:31:40,279 --> 00:31:41,680
Then where could she go?

638
00:31:44,519 --> 00:31:45,759
Boss, look.

639
00:31:46,200 --> 00:31:47,799
It's the escort team we robbed last time.

640
00:31:49,039 --> 00:31:49,559
Let's go.

641
00:31:49,720 --> 00:31:50,000
Okay.

642
00:32:17,599 --> 00:32:18,400
Take a rest here.

643
00:32:32,799 --> 00:32:33,880
Hey, what are you doing?

644
00:32:33,880 --> 00:32:34,839
I should ask you.

645
00:32:35,680 --> 00:32:37,400
We met bandits on this road.

646
00:32:37,799 --> 00:32:39,559
If you appear like this again,

647
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:40,640
you may lose your life.

648
00:32:41,559 --> 00:32:42,799
No way.

649
00:32:42,799 --> 00:32:44,200
Are there really bandits here?

650
00:32:51,079 --> 00:32:52,480
Chief Su,

651
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:53,920
next time,

652
00:32:53,920 --> 00:32:55,160
let's talk it out.

653
00:32:55,319 --> 00:32:57,160
Don't start with weapons.

654
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:59,240
You're the best at dodging.

655
00:32:59,240 --> 00:33:00,319
Who can hurt you?

656
00:33:00,839 --> 00:33:02,200
Besides, we'll go our separate ways

657
00:33:02,200 --> 00:33:03,400
we'll go our separate ways.

658
00:33:03,480 --> 00:33:04,799
There won't be a next time.

659
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:07,920
Chief Su,

660
00:33:07,920 --> 00:33:08,960
if you ask me,

661
00:33:08,960 --> 00:33:10,559
your acting skills are really impressive.

662
00:33:10,640 --> 00:33:11,960
The way you cried out "mom" and "dad",

663
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:13,079
it sounded even more sincere than mine.

664
00:33:19,400 --> 00:33:20,200
I'm sorry

665
00:33:20,400 --> 00:33:21,480
for dragging you into this.

666
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:25,240
I haven't called out "mom" and "dad" for a long time.

667
00:33:27,680 --> 00:33:28,480
This is for you.

668
00:33:31,839 --> 00:33:32,640
Wait.

669
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:34,440
What's this?

670
00:33:35,039 --> 00:33:36,359
It's your proof.

671
00:33:37,119 --> 00:33:38,440
It shows that you didn't lose the escort,

672
00:33:38,559 --> 00:33:40,279
and the marriage has nothing to do with you.

673
00:33:43,880 --> 00:33:45,200
You finally did something right.

674
00:33:45,279 --> 00:33:46,680
Let's just say goodbye.

675
00:33:47,599 --> 00:33:49,160
I gave you the escort fee.

676
00:33:49,160 --> 00:33:49,880
Chief Escort Su.

677
00:33:50,240 --> 00:33:50,759
All right.

678
00:33:50,759 --> 00:33:52,279
Since I promised to take you,

679
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:53,519
I won't leave you behind.

680
00:33:56,240 --> 00:33:57,200
Besides the Nebula Assembly,

681
00:33:57,400 --> 00:33:59,160
you also need to study at Qiyong Academy.

682
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:00,200
You've worked hard.

683
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:02,240
Is there a Qiyong Academy?

684
00:34:02,839 --> 00:34:04,720
You grew up in Yunjing City.

685
00:34:08,079 --> 00:34:08,639
You are

686
00:34:08,639 --> 00:34:09,760
a liar.

687
00:34:15,239 --> 00:34:17,079
Boss, why didn't we think of

688
00:34:17,880 --> 00:34:19,320
robbing in the city?

689
00:34:20,079 --> 00:34:22,079
Yunjing City is full of rich people.

690
00:34:22,760 --> 00:34:25,440
It's much better than robbing in the wilderness.

691
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:26,639
Hahaha.

692
00:34:32,519 --> 00:34:35,679
It's not convenient to rob in the city.

693
00:34:36,039 --> 00:34:37,239
Then why do you go to the city?

694
00:34:38,960 --> 00:34:39,920
To the Escort Agency.

695
00:34:39,920 --> 00:34:40,840
Ah?

696
00:34:42,719 --> 00:34:43,840
Robbery?

697
00:35:02,400 --> 00:35:04,079
Boss Su,

698
00:35:05,599 --> 00:35:06,639
I just want to know

699
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:10,280
if your niece will come back tonight.

700
00:35:10,400 --> 00:35:11,480
What are you saying?

701
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:13,239
Are you cursing her?

702
00:35:13,599 --> 00:35:14,559
The thing is,

703
00:35:14,679 --> 00:35:17,239
I heard that the White Wolf robbed Ning'an yesterday.

704
00:35:18,480 --> 00:35:19,760
The White Wolf is coming?

705
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:23,440
He is cruel and ruthless.

706
00:35:23,440 --> 00:35:24,320
He killed people, robbed goods,

707
00:35:24,320 --> 00:35:25,199
and raped women.

708
00:35:25,280 --> 00:35:27,239
He has done all the bad things.

709
00:35:27,920 --> 00:35:29,800
When he goes wild,

710
00:35:29,840 --> 00:35:31,400
he won't even spare his brothers.

711
00:35:32,880 --> 00:35:34,480
White Wolf is the escort agency's nemesis.

712
00:35:35,320 --> 00:35:38,000
Su Yuejiao and the others haven't come back yet.

713
00:35:38,719 --> 00:35:40,559
Did they really get robbed by White Wolf?

714
00:35:41,440 --> 00:35:42,679
Well.

715
00:35:43,400 --> 00:35:45,239
Congratulations to Boss Su.

716
00:35:45,599 --> 00:35:46,400
For what?

717
00:35:47,159 --> 00:35:48,760
If White Wolf meets her,

718
00:35:48,800 --> 00:35:50,360
can she come back alive?

719
00:35:50,639 --> 00:35:53,320
This escort agency won't be yours anymore.

720
00:35:54,400 --> 00:35:55,199
No.

721
00:35:56,000 --> 00:35:57,280
If she dies,

722
00:35:57,880 --> 00:36:00,800
how can I get her huge dowry?

723
00:36:02,599 --> 00:36:03,440
It's not a good deal.

724
00:36:04,199 --> 00:36:05,000
It's not a good deal.

725
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:06,559
She can't die.
